Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libgtk-4-1, libadwaita-1-0, libsqlite3-0, libssl3t64 | libssl3, libnotify4, libwebkitgtk-6.0-4, libsoup-3.0-0, libdbus-1-3
Description: Native Yandex Messenger for Linux
 A native GTK4 + Rust implementation of Yandex Messenger (Telemost)
 for Linux desktop. Features:
  - Real-time messaging via WebSocket
  - Audio/video calls (Telemost) via WebKit2GTK
  - File sharing and voice messages
  - Desktop notifications
  - System tray integration
